I understand Robin's suggestion to be a test for just one person, even
though two people are involved. So if the testee knows Lojban well enough
to talk the 'tester' through solving whatever the puzzle or other task is,
then he 'knows' Lojban. The 'tester', OTOH, should be a native Lojban
speaker with no other language in common with the testee.

I don't think this would be an adequate test, but it's a start.

stevo

